{"id":57385,"date":"2026-08-06T11:53:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-06T10:53:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/penacova-trail-do-centro\/"},"modified":"2026-09-07T11:23:30","modified_gmt":"2026-09-07T10:23:30","slug":"penacova-trail-do-centro","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/penacova-trail-do-centro\/","title":{"rendered":"Penacova Trail do Centro 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Penacova Trail do Centro 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Penacova Trail do Centro 2026<\/strong> decorre nos dias <strong>5 e 6 de setembro de 2026<\/strong>, com centro nevr\u00e1lgico na paradis\u00edaca <strong>Praia Fluvial do Reconquinho<\/strong>, em <strong>Penacova<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Coimbra<\/strong>. Organizado pela prestigiada equipa <strong>Carlos S\u00e1 Nature Events<\/strong> com o apoio da <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Penacova<\/strong>, o evento percorre a fant\u00e1stica rede de trilhos do Centro de Trail Running de Penacova.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A jornada tem in\u00edcio no s\u00e1bado, <strong>5 de setembro<\/strong>, com o divertido <strong>Trail Kids<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>18:30<\/strong> e o competitivo <strong>Pr\u00f3logo 2 km<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>19:00<\/strong>. No domingo, <strong>6 de setembro<\/strong>, disputam-se os grandes desafios de montanha: o <strong>Ultra Trail 46 km<\/strong> e o <strong>Trail 31 km<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s <strong>08:00<\/strong>), o <strong>Trail Sprint 18 km<\/strong> (\u00e0s <strong>09:00<\/strong>) e a <strong>Caminhada 11 km<\/strong> com partida nos emblem\u00e1ticos Moinhos de Gavinhos \u00e0s <strong>10:00<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">5 e 6 de Setembro de 2026 \u00e0s 08:00